 ## Background
-Automating vortex identification with learned classifiers was first explored by Deng et al. [21], who introduced Vortex-Net [S1, unofficial]. The method addresses the bottleneck of manual threshold selection in traditional vortex criteria (like $\lambda_2$) by learning the decision boundary directly from labeled examples generated by an existing criterion (IVD) [S1, unofficial].
